        // Description: Bypass the Event Trace Windows(ETW) and unhook ntdll.
        // Reference: https://github.com/unkvolism/Fuck-Etw
        $string1_Fuck_Etw_offensive_tool_keyword = /\/etw\-fuck\.cpp/ nocase ascii wide
        // Description: Bypass the Event Trace Windows(ETW) and unhook ntdll.
