rule rule_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword
{
    meta:
        description = "Detection patterns for the tool 'metasploit' taken from the ThreatHunting-Keywords github project"
        author = "@mthcht"
        reference = "https://github.com/mthcht/ThreatHunting-Keywords"
        tool = "metasploit"
        rule_category = "offensive_tool_keyword"

    strings:
        // Description: Metasploit is a widely-used. open-source framework designed for penetration testing. vulnerability assessment. and exploit development. It provides security professionals and researchers with a comprehensive platform to discover. exploit. and validate vulnerabilities in computer systems and networks. Metasploit includes a large database of pre-built exploits. payloads. and auxiliary modules that can be used to test various attack vectors. identify security weaknesses. and simulate real-world cyberattacks. By utilizing Metasploit. security teams can better understand potential threats and improve their overall security posture.
        // Reference: https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework
        $string1_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = /\s\-c\s\'import\spty\;pty\.spawn\(\\"\/bin\/sh/
        // Description: Metasploit is a widely-used. open-source framework designed for penetration testing. vulnerability assessment. and exploit development. It provides security professionals and researchers with a comprehensive platform to discover. exploit. and validate vulnerabilities in computer systems and networks. Metasploit includes a large database of pre-built exploits. payloads. and auxiliary modules that can be used to test various attack vectors. identify security weaknesses. and simulate real-world cyberattacks. By utilizing Metasploit. security teams can better understand potential threats and improve their overall security posture.
        // Reference: https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework
        $string2_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = " install metasploit-framework" nocase ascii wide
        // Description: metasploit command lines patterns
        // Reference: https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework
        $string3_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = " LPORT=4444" nocase ascii wide
        // Description: Metasploit is a widely-used. open-source framework designed for penetration testing. vulnerability assessment. and exploit development. It provides security professionals and researchers with a comprehensive platform to discover. exploit. and validate vulnerabilities in computer systems and networks. Metasploit includes a large database of pre-built exploits. payloads. and auxiliary modules that can be used to test various attack vectors. identify security weaknesses. and simulate real-world cyberattacks. By utilizing Metasploit. security teams can better understand potential threats and improve their overall security posture.
        // Reference: https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-omnibus
        $string4_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = " metasploit-omnibus-builder " nocase ascii wide
        // Description: Metasploit is a widely-used. open-source framework designed for penetration testing. vulnerability assessment. and exploit development. It provides security professionals and researchers with a comprehensive platform to discover. exploit. and validate vulnerabilities in computer systems and networks. Metasploit includes a large database of pre-built exploits. payloads. and auxiliary modules that can be used to test various attack vectors. identify security weaknesses. and simulate real-world cyberattacks. By utilizing Metasploit. security teams can better understand potential threats and improve their overall security posture.
        // Reference: https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework
        $string5_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = " msfdb run  " nocase ascii wide
        // Description: Metasploit is a widely-used. open-source framework designed for penetration testing. vulnerability assessment. and exploit development. It provides security professionals and researchers with a comprehensive platform to discover. exploit. and validate vulnerabilities in computer systems and networks. Metasploit includes a large database of pre-built exploits. payloads. and auxiliary modules that can be used to test various attack vectors. identify security weaknesses. and simulate real-world cyberattacks. By utilizing Metasploit. security teams can better understand potential threats and improve their overall security posture.
        // Reference: https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-omnibus
        $string6_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = /\smsfremove\.ps1/ nocase ascii wide
        // Description: Metasploit is a widely-used. open-source framework designed for penetration testing. vulnerability assessment. and exploit development. It provides security professionals and researchers with a comprehensive platform to discover. exploit. and validate vulnerabilities in computer systems and networks. Metasploit includes a large database of pre-built exploits. payloads. and auxiliary modules that can be used to test various attack vectors. identify security weaknesses. and simulate real-world cyberattacks. By utilizing Metasploit. security teams can better understand potential threats and improve their overall security posture.
        // Reference: https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-omnibus
        $string7_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = /\smsfupdate\.ps1/ nocase ascii wide
        // Description: Metasploit is a widely-used. open-source framework designed for penetration testing. vulnerability assessment. and exploit development. It provides security professionals and researchers with a comprehensive platform to discover. exploit. and validate vulnerabilities in computer systems and networks. Metasploit includes a large database of pre-built exploits. payloads. and auxiliary modules that can be used to test various attack vectors. identify security weaknesses. and simulate real-world cyberattacks. By utilizing Metasploit. security teams can better understand potential threats and improve their overall security posture.
        // Reference: https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework
        $string8_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = /\s\-\-payload\s.{0,1000}\s\-\-platform\swindows/ nocase ascii wide
        // Description: Metasploit is a widely-used. open-source framework designed for penetration testing. vulnerability assessment. and exploit development. It provides security professionals and researchers with a comprehensive platform to discover. exploit. and validate vulnerabilities in computer systems and networks. Metasploit includes a large database of pre-built exploits. payloads. and auxiliary modules that can be used to test various attack vectors. identify security weaknesses. and simulate real-world cyberattacks. By utilizing Metasploit. security teams can better understand potential threats and improve their overall security posture.
        // Reference: https://www.metasploit.com/
        $string9_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = /\s\-q\s\-r\skarma\.rc_\.txt/ nocase ascii wide
        // Description: Metasploit is a widely-used. open-source framework designed for penetration testing. vulnerability assessment. and exploit development. It provides security professionals and researchers with a comprehensive platform to discover. exploit. and validate vulnerabilities in computer systems and networks. Metasploit includes a large database of pre-built exploits. payloads. and auxiliary modules that can be used to test various attack vectors. identify security weaknesses. and simulate real-world cyberattacks. By utilizing Metasploit. security teams can better understand potential threats and improve their overall security posture.
        // Reference: https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-omnibus
        $string10_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = " rapid7/msf-ubuntu" nocase ascii wide
        // Description: Metasploit is a widely-used. open-source framework designed for penetration testing. vulnerability assessment. and exploit development. It provides security professionals and researchers with a comprehensive platform to discover. exploit. and validate vulnerabilities in computer systems and networks. Metasploit includes a large database of pre-built exploits. payloads. and auxiliary modules that can be used to test various attack vectors. identify security weaknesses. and simulate real-world cyberattacks. By utilizing Metasploit. security teams can better understand potential threats and improve their overall security posture.
        // Reference: https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework
        $string11_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = /\.\/msfinstall/
        // Description: Metasploit is a widely-used. open-source framework designed for penetration testing. vulnerability assessment. and exploit development. It provides security professionals and researchers with a comprehensive platform to discover. exploit. and validate vulnerabilities in computer systems and networks. Metasploit includes a large database of pre-built exploits. payloads. and auxiliary modules that can be used to test various attack vectors. identify security weaknesses. and simulate real-world cyberattacks. By utilizing Metasploit. security teams can better understand potential threats and improve their overall security posture.
        // Reference: https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework
        $string12_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = /\/.{0,1000}_priv_esc\./ nocase ascii wide
        // Description: Metasploit is a widely-used. open-source framework designed for penetration testing. vulnerability assessment. and exploit development. It provides security professionals and researchers with a comprehensive platform to discover. exploit. and validate vulnerabilities in computer systems and networks. Metasploit includes a large database of pre-built exploits. payloads. and auxiliary modules that can be used to test various attack vectors. identify security weaknesses. and simulate real-world cyberattacks. By utilizing Metasploit. security teams can better understand potential threats and improve their overall security posture.
        // Reference: https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework
        $string13_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = /\/.{0,1000}SandboxEscapes\// nocase ascii wide
        // Description: exploit used by Dispossessor ransomware group
        // Reference: https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework
        $string14_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = "/admin/smb/ms17_010_command" nocase ascii wide
        // Description: Metasploit is a widely-used. open-source framework designed for penetration testing. vulnerability assessment. and exploit development. It provides security professionals and researchers with a comprehensive platform to discover. exploit. and validate vulnerabilities in computer systems and networks. Metasploit includes a large database of pre-built exploits. payloads. and auxiliary modules that can be used to test various attack vectors. identify security weaknesses. and simulate real-world cyberattacks. By utilizing Metasploit. security teams can better understand potential threats and improve their overall security posture.
        // Reference: https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework
        $string15_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = /\/arp_scanner\./ nocase ascii wide
        // Description: Metasploit is a widely-used. open-source framework designed for penetration testing. vulnerability assessment. and exploit development. It provides security professionals and researchers with a comprehensive platform to discover. exploit. and validate vulnerabilities in computer systems and networks. Metasploit includes a large database of pre-built exploits. payloads. and auxiliary modules that can be used to test various attack vectors. identify security weaknesses. and simulate real-world cyberattacks. By utilizing Metasploit. security teams can better understand potential threats and improve their overall security posture.
        // Reference: https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework
        $string16_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = "/auxiliary/scanner/" nocase ascii wide
        // Description: Metasploit is a widely-used. open-source framework designed for penetration testing. vulnerability assessment. and exploit development. It provides security professionals and researchers with a comprehensive platform to discover. exploit. and validate vulnerabilities in computer systems and networks. Metasploit includes a large database of pre-built exploits. payloads. and auxiliary modules that can be used to test various attack vectors. identify security weaknesses. and simulate real-world cyberattacks. By utilizing Metasploit. security teams can better understand potential threats and improve their overall security posture.
        // Reference: https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework
        $string17_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = "/batik_svg" nocase ascii wide
        // Description: Metasploit is a widely-used. open-source framework designed for penetration testing. vulnerability assessment. and exploit development. It provides security professionals and researchers with a comprehensive platform to discover. exploit. and validate vulnerabilities in computer systems and networks. Metasploit includes a large database of pre-built exploits. payloads. and auxiliary modules that can be used to test various attack vectors. identify security weaknesses. and simulate real-world cyberattacks. By utilizing Metasploit. security teams can better understand potential threats and improve their overall security posture.
        // Reference: https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework
        $string18_metasploit_offensive_tool_keyword = "/BitsArbitraryFileMove" nocase ascii wide
        // Description: Metasploit is a widely-used. open-source framework designed for penetration testing. vulnerability assessment. and exploit development. It provides security professionals and researchers with a comprehensive platform to discover. exploit. and validate vulnerabilities in computer systems and networks. Metasploit includes a large database of pre-built exploits. payloads. and auxiliary modules that can be used to test various attack vectors. identify security weaknesses. and simulate real-world cyberattacks. By utilizing Metasploit. security teams can better understand potential threats and improve their overall security posture.
